flowchart TD
  subgraph owners["the three owners that report"]
    MB["mission broker\nopens and closes a mission by calling observe directly:\nit runs in this process"]
    ER["evidence recorder\nanother process: it hands over EvidenceSealed\nwith the segment's digest, over the edge"]
    JEPA["JEPA runtime\nanother process: it hands over PromotionAccepted /\nPromotionRolledBack on a move"]
  end

  EDGE["POST /braid — the write edge the two other-process strands cross\nfrozen BraidEvent in, the GET /braid view out; a failed dispatch is 503.\nNot deduplicated: the count is the events folded, so a re-delivered\nmission_opened counts twice"]
  OBS["observe(state, event)\nthe sole mutator of BraidState"]
  REFUSED["the variant the edge refuses\nrecovery's Quarantined is not a strand report: the edge refuses it with 400,\nand the dispatch (renaming *.partial files aside) stays in the crate's fold,\nover a local root — no strand, and no state moved"]
  STATE["BraidState (the agent's own copy)\ngeneration · session_id · open_missions ·\nlast_promotion_ns · last_quarantine_ns —\nthe fold, rebuildable by replaying the stream;\nthe wire view adds schema_version"]
  COPIES["the durable copies — where the records live\nMCAP: quarantine_partials moves the partials aside\nregistry: route() writes a rollback's reason, a handle the fold does not hold\na sealed segment is its own record — the braid keeps none of them"]
  READ["GET /braid — the read every strand and page polls\nthe console's Mission view, the TUI's Braid line and the operator page read it;\nBeliefClock::decision_latency_ns() reads the arena's own stamps instead —\nit is a view over the region, not a field of this state"]

  MB --> OBS
  ER --> EDGE
  JEPA --> EDGE
  EDGE -- "the frozen BraidEvent" --> OBS
  OBS -- "the fold" --> STATE
  REFUSED -. "the crate's fold, over a local root" .-> COPIES
  STATE --> READ
  COPIES --> READ
